  "falsification_criteria": [
    "Reject if held-out future return signed opposite to signal-bar direction is nonpositive after registered costs.",
    "Reject unless at least 30 one-to-one, no-reuse matched controls exist and the normal-approximation 95% lower confidence bound of paired extreme-minus-control signed 30m returns is strictly positive.",
